hadiths[200]{hadithnumber,text}:
"201","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke jab Abd al-Qais ka wafd aaya to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Har shakhs apne nafs ka zimmedar hai, aur har qaum un (bartanon) se pi sakti hai jinhen woh munasib samjhe."
"202","[AI-translation] Hazrat Zaid bin Khalid (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne yeh khutba Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke munh se sun kar hasil kiya, aur is mein yeh bhi tha: Har aane wali cheez qareeb hai."
"203","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa Ash'ari (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Har aankh zaniya hai."
"204","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Har cheez taqdeer se hai, hatta ke aajizi aur danayi (bhi taqdeer se hain)."
"205","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek hadees mein farmaya: Aur har sahib-e-ilm ilm ka bhooka hai."
"206","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Allah ki aisi koi ibadat nahin ki gayi jo deen mein fiqh (samajh) se afzal ho, aur beshak ek faqeeh shaitan par hazar aabidon se bhari hai. Aur har cheez ka sutoon hota hai, aur is deen ka sutoon fiqh hai. Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) farmate hain: Agar main fiqh hasil karne ke liye ek ghadi baithun to mujhe yeh raat se le kar subah tak (poori raat) ibadat karne se zyada mehboob hai."
"207","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Har cheez ka sutoon hota hai, aur is deen ka sutoon fiqh hai."
"208","[AI-translation] Hazrat Tamim Dari (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Har mushtabah cheez haram hai, aur deen mein koi ishtibah nahin."
"209","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se har ek nigahban hai, aur tum mein se har ek apne ma-tehaton ka zimmedar hai."
"210","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Roz-e-Qayamat har dhokebaz ke liye us ki dhokebazi ke mutabiq ek jhanda hoga."
"211","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Roz-e-Qayamat har dhokebaz ka ek parcham hoga jis se woh pehchana jaega. Aur Muslim ne bhi use apni sanad ke sath riwayat kiya hai: Roz-e-Qayamat har dhokebaz ka us ki dhokebazi ke mutabiq ek parcham hoga jis se woh pehchana jaega."
"212","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Roz-e-Qayamat, logon ke darmiyan sab se pehle jin muqadmat ka faisla kiya jaega woh khoon (yani qatl) ke honge."
"213","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Sab se pehle jis cheez ka hisab liya jaega woh namaz hogi, aur logon ke darmiyan sab se pehle jis muqadme ka faisla hoga woh khoon-rezi ke bare mein hoga."
"214","[AI-translation] Maimoon bin Mehran se riwayat hai ke Hazrat Umm Darda (Raziyallahu anha) se poocha gaya ke kya aap ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kuch suna hai? Unhon ne kaha: Haan, main ne Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko yeh farmate suna: (Roz-e-Qayamat) tarazu mein sab se pehle husn-e-khuluq ko rakha jaega."
"215","[AI-translation] Dawood bin Abu Hind kehte hain ke mera Jadilah muqam par ek ghazi se guzar hua, us ne kaha: Main ne Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ko yeh kehte suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Is ummat se sab se pehle haya aur amanat uthayi jaegi."
"216","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhare deen se sab se pehle jo cheez uthayi jaegi woh amanat hai, aur sab se aakhir mein jo cheez uthayi jaegi woh namaz hai."
"217","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhare deen se sab se pehle jo cheez uthayi jaegi woh amanat hai, aur sab se aakhir mein jo cheez uthayi jaegi woh namaz hai."
"218","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Talhah apne walid se riwayat karte hain ke beshak Hazrat Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ne ek shakhs se, jise Ufair kaha jata tha, kaha: Tu ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko kya farmate suna hai? Us ne kaha: Main ne Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko yeh farmate suna: Mohabbat bhi wirse mein milti hai aur nafrat bhi wirse mein milti hai."
"219","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Darda (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: (Had se badhi hui) mohabbat kisi cheez ki tujhe andha aur behra kar degi."
"220","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tohfa sama'at aur basarat le jata hai."
"221","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bhalayi ghodon ki peshaniyon se Roz-e-Qayamat tak bandhi hui hai."
"222","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Barkat ghodon ki peshaniyon mein hai."
"223","[AI-translation] Hazrat Urwah al-Bariqi (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Bhalayi ghodon ki peshaniyon se Roz-e-Qayamat tak bandhi hui hai."
"224","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ghodon ki barkat un ke surkh rang mein hai."
"225","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Safar azab ka ek hissa hai."
"226","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Auraton ki ita'at nadamat ki taraf le jati hai."
"227","[AI-translation] Hazrat Huzaifah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Museebat guftagu se wabasta hai."
"228","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Museebat guftagu se wabasta hai."
"229","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Roza nisf sabr hai, aur har cheez ki zakat hoti hai, aur badan ki zakat roza hai."
"230","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Roza-dar ki dua radd nahin hoti."
"231","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Masud (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sardiyon mein roza thandi ghaneemat hai."
"232","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Miswak ka istemal aadmi ki fasahat badhata hai."
"233","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi ka husn us ki zaban ki fasahat mein hai."
"234","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Imam zimmedar hai (namaz ka), aur muazzin ameen hai (namaz ke waqt ka). Ae Allah! Imamon ko hidayat de aur muazzinon ko bakhsh de."
"235","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Roz-e-Qayamat muazzinon ki gardanein sab se lambi hon gi."
"236","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri shafa'at meri ummat ke un logon ke liye hai jo kabeera gunah karte hain."
"237","[AI-translation] Main ne Qazi Abu Abdullah Muhammad bin Salamah ko suna, woh Allah ki qasam kha kar keh rahe the ke main ne Abul Abbas Ahmad bin Husain ko suna, woh Allah ki qasam kha kar keh rahe the ke main ne Abul Hasan Ahmad bin Abdur Rahman bin Bard ko suna, woh Allah ki qasam kha kar keh rahe the ke main ne Ibn Nafees ko suna, woh Allah ki qasam kha kar keh rahe the ke main ne Ali bin Muhammad bin Ismail ko suna, woh Allah ki qasam kha kar keh rahe the ke main ne Hudbah bin Khalid ko suna, woh Allah ki qasam kha kar keh rahe the ke main ne Abu Janab Qassab ko suna, woh Allah ki qasam kha kar keh rahe the ke main ne Ziyad al-Namiri ko suna, woh Allah ki qasam kha kar keh rahe the ke main ne Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) ko suna, woh Allah ki qasam kha kar keh rahe the ke unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Meri shafa'at meri ummat ke un logon ke liye hai jo kabeera gunah karte hain."
"238","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ansar mere mukhlis sathi aur raaz-dan hain."
"239","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ka hath jama'at par hai."
"240","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Khamoshi hikmat hai, aur us par amal karne wale bahut kam hain."
"241","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Darda (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Rizq bande ko maut se bhi zyada shiddat se talash karta hai."
"242","[AI-translation] Hajjaj bin Sulaiman Ru'eeni kehte hain ke main ne Ibn Lahi'ah se kaha: Ma'ishat mein narmi ba'z tijarat se behtar hai. Yeh ek aisi baat hai jise main apni buzurg auraton ko kehte sunta hun. To unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Muhammad bin Munkadir ne Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) ke hawale se bayan kiya ke unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko yeh farmate suna: Ma'ishat mein narmi ba'z tijarat se behtar hai."
"243","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Buzdil tajir mehroom rehta hai, aur bahadur tajir (kamyabi) pata hai."
"244","[AI-translation] Hazrat Rafi' (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Husn-e-khuluq taraqqi ka zariya hai aur bad-khuluqi nahoosat hai."
"245","[AI-translation] Hazrat Rafi' bin Makees, jo Hudaibiyah mein shareek hone wale sahaba mein se hain, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Husn-e-khuluq taraqqi ka zariya hai aur bad-khuluqi nahoosat hai. Neki umar mein izafe ka sabab hai aur sadqa buri maut ko rokta hai."
"246","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) apne bhai Hazrat Fazl bin Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat karte hain, jinhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Duniya ki ruswayi aakhirat ki ruswayi se halki hai."
"247","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qabr aakhirat ki manzilon mein se pehli manzil hai."
"248","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usman ke aazad-kardah ghulam Hani kehte hain ke Hazrat Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) jab kisi qabr ke paas khade hote to itna rote ke aap ki dadhi bheeg jati. Hani kehte hain ke un se kaha jata: Aap ke samne Jannat aur Jahannam ka zikr kiya jata hai to (itna) nahin rote aur is (qabr) par (is qadar) rote hain? To unhon ne kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak qabr aakhirat ki manzilon mein se pehli manzil hai. Aur yeh hadees bayan ki ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"249","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sabr museebat ki pehli chot par hai."
"250","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki beti Hazrat Ruqayyah (Raziyallahu anha) ki ta'ziyat ki gayi jo Hazrat Usman bin Affan (Raziyallahu anhu) ki biwi thin to Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sab ta'reef Allah ke liye hai, betiyon ko (maut ke baad) dafnana izzat o sharaf ka ba'is hai."
"251","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Maut ka maidan saath aur sattar saal (umar) ke darmiyan hai."
"252","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri ummat (logon) ki umrein saath aur sattar saal ke darmiyan hon gi, aur bahut kam is se tajawuz karenge."
"253","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne hamein dhoka diya woh hum mein se nahin, aur jo fareb, makkari aur dhokebazi karega woh aag mein hoga."
"254","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne hamein dhoka diya woh hum mein se nahin, aur jo fareb, makkari aur dhokebazi karega woh aag mein hoga."
"255","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jhooti qasam gharon ko weeran kar deti hai."
"256","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jhooti qasam maal to bikwa sakti hai, lekin kamayi ki barkat ko khatm kar deti hai."
"257","[AI-translation] Yeh riwayat Abdur Rahman bin Ya'qub Jahni se ek doosri sanad ke sath isi tarah marwi hai ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"258","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: (Jhooti) qasam maal to bikwa sakti hai, lekin barkat ko khatm kar deti hai."
"259","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qasam us ki niyyat ke mutabiq hai jo doosre se qasam dilwata hai."
"260","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qasam ya to todi jati hai ya us par sharminda hona padta hai."
"261","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qasam ko todna padta hai ya us par sharminda hona padta hai."
"262","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Salam hamari jama'at ke liye tohfa hai aur hamare zimmiyon ke liye aman hai."
"263","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Woh ilm jis se koi faida na uthaya jae us khazane ki tarah hai jis mein se kuch kharch na kiya jae."
"264","[AI-translation] Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahabi, Hazrat Sinan bin Sanah Aslami (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo khana kha kar shukr ada kare us ka ajar sabr karne wale roza-dar ke barabar hai."
"265","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna ... aur unhon ne use mukhtasar bayan kiya ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"266","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bande aur kufr ke darmiyan (namaz) chhodne ka amal hai."
"267","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bande aur kufr ke darmiyan (namaz) chhodne ka amal hai."
"268","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Deen mein namaz ka muqam jism mein sar ke muqam jaisa hai."
"269","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Baith kar namaz padhne ka ajar khade ho kar namaz padhne ke ajar ka aadha hai."
"270","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Darda (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Zakat Islam ka khazana hai."
"271","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mardon ki khushbu woh hai jis ka rang chhupa ho aur jis ki khushbu phailti ho, aur auraton ki khushbu woh hai jis ka rang zahir ho aur jis ki khushbu chhupi ho."
"272","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mardon ki khushbu woh hai jis ka rang chhupa ho aur jis ki mehak phailti ho, aur auraton ki khushbu woh hai jis ka rang zahir ho aur jis ki mehak chhupi ho."
"273","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mitti bachchon ki dilchaspi hai."
"274","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Roohein jama shuda lashkaron ki tarah hain; jo ek doosre se (aalam-e-arwah mein) manoos thin yahan (duniya mein) ek doosre se ulfat rakhti hain, aur jo wahan ek doosre se ajnabi thin yahan ek doosre ki mukhalif hain."
"275","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah kehte hain ke main ne Hazrat Hasan bin Ali (Raziyallahu anhuma) se poocha: Aap ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kya yaad kiya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne un se yeh (hadees) yaad ki hai: Sachchayi itminan hai aur jhoot shak hai."
"276","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Quran maal hai; us ke baad koi faqr nahin, aur us ke baghair koi ghina nahin. Darqutni kehte hain: Abu Mu'awiyah ne use mursal riwayat kiya hai Al-A'mash se, Yazid al-Raqashi se, Al-Hasan se, aur yahi zyada sahih hai."
"277","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Taqdeer par iman ranj o gham door karta hai."
"278","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Duniya se be-raghbati dil aur badan ko aaram deti hai, aur duniya ki khwahish ranj o gham badhati hai, aur susti dil ko sakht karti hai."
"279","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Darda (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aalim aur seekhne wala donon khair mein shareek hain, aur baqi log shar hain; un mein koi khair nahin."
"280","[AI-translation] Hazrat Samurah bin Jundub (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hath us cheez ka zimmedar hai jo us ne (udhar) li hai yahan tak ke use wapas kar de."
"281","[AI-translation] Hazrat Samurah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hath us cheez ka zimmedar hai jo us ne (udhar) li hai yahan tak ke use wapas kar de."
"282","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bachcha usi ka hai jis ke bistar par woh paida ho, aur zaniya ke liye pathar hai."
"283","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bachcha usi ka hai jis ke bistar par woh paida ho, aur zaniya ke liye pathar hain."
"284","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mehman-nawazi dehatiyon par (wajib) hai aur shehriyon par (wajib) nahin."
"285","[AI-translation] Hazrat Husain bin Ali (Raziyallahu anhuma) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Sa'il ka haq hai, agarche woh ghode par sawar ho kar aae."
"286","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Bukhl se badh kar kaun si beemari ho sakti hai?"
"287","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Bukhl se badh kar kaun si beemari ho sakti hai?"
"288","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apna diya hua tohfa wapas le le woh us kutte ki tarah hai jo apni qai chaat le. Buri misal hamare liye nahin."
"289","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sabze ko dekhna benayi badhata hai, aur khoobsurat aurat ko dekhna bhi benayi badhata hai."
"290","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Roz-e-Qayamat meri ummat aegi un ke chehre, hath aur paon wuzu ke nishan se chamakte honge."
"291","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Sa'd (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Taliyan bajana auraton ke liye hai aur Subhan Allah kehna mardon ke liye hai."
"292","[AI-translation] Hazrat Huzaifah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Nazar Iblees ke teeron mein se ek teer hai. Jo use Allah ke khauf se chhod de, Allah use aisa iman ata farmayega jis ki mithas woh apne dil mein mehsoos karega."
"293","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: (Shahwat bhari) nazar shaitan ke zehreelay teeron mein se ek hai. Jo use mere khauf se chhod de, main use aisa iman ata farmayunga jis ki mithas woh apne dil mein mehsoos karega."
"294","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ghar, ghode aur aurat mein nahoosat hai."
"295","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Do nematein aisi hain jin mein aksar log khasare mein hain: (ek) sehat aur (doosri) faraghat."
"296","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Arabon ke liye halakat hai qareeb aane wale shar ki wajah se."
"297","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin ki izzat us ke taqwe mein hai, us ka waqar us ke akhlaq mein hai, us ka nasab us ke deen mein hai, aur buzdili aur bahaduri fitri khaslatein hain; Allah unhen jis mein chahta hai rakhta hai."
"298","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sadqa, beemariyon ko chhupana, aur museebaton ko chhupana khair ke khazanon mein se hain."
"299","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek martaba khaime mein baithe the jab Sa'ib bin Abd Yazid Aap ke paas aae, aur un ke sath un ka beta tha. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne donon ko dekha aur farmaya: Aadmi ki khush-naseebi mein se hai ke woh apne walid se mushabeh ho."
"300","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Husn-e-khuluq aadmi ki khush-naseebi ka hissa hai."
"301","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo duniya mein achche hain woh aakhirat mein achche honge, aur jo duniya mein bure hain woh aakhirat mein bure honge."
"302","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Amanat-dar khazanchi jo woh de jo use dene ka hukm diya gaya ho (Allah ki rah mein) khush-dili ke sath, woh bhi sadqa dene walon mein shumar kiya jata hai."
"303","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Amanat-dar khazanchi jo woh de jo use dene ka hukm diya gaya ho (Allah ki rah mein) khush-dili ke sath, woh bhi sadqa dene walon mein shumar kiya jata hai."
"304","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Badshah Allah ka saya hai zameen par; har mazloom us ke paas panah leta hai."
"305","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Yazid bin Khunais Makki kehte hain ke hum Sufyan Sauri ke paas un ki iyadat ke liye hazir hue, aur Sa'id bin Hassan bhi un ke paas iyadat karne aagae, Sufyan ne un se kaha: Mujhe dobara woh hadees sunao jo tum ne mujhe bayan ki thi. Unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Umm Salih ne Safiyyah bint Shaibah se, us ne Ummul Momineen Hazrat Umm Habibah (Raziyallahu anha) se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ibn Adam ki har baat us ke khilaf padti hai, us ke haq mein nahin jati sawae neki ka hukm dene, burayi se mana karne aur Allah ka zikr karne ke."
"306","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kaam mein ghaur o fikr, isteqamat, miyana-rawi, aur khamoshi nabuwwat ka chhabbeeswan hissa hain."
"307","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Ambiya (Alaihimussalam) peshwa hain, fuqaha sardar hain, aur un ki majlison mein baithna (ilm mein) izafe ka sabab hai."
"308","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma bint Abi Bakr (Raziyallahu anha) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karti hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo woh zahir kare jo us ke paas nahin woh us ki tarah hai jo jhoot ke do libas pehne (farebi)."
"309","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma bint Abi Bakr (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo woh hone ka dawa kare jo use diya nahin gaya woh us ki tarah hai jo jhoot ka libas pehne."
"310","[AI-translation] Musa bin Ja'far apne walid se, woh apne dada se muttasil sanad ke sath riwayat karte hain, unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Khane se pehle wuzu karna faqr door karta hai, aur khane ke baad wuzu karna sagheera gunah mitata hai aur benayi durust karta hai."
"311","[AI-translation] Abadilah (Abdullah bin Umar, Abdullah bin Masud, Abdullah bin Zubair aur Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr Raziyallahu anhum) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qissa-go ghazab (Ilahi) ka muntazir rehta hai aur use sunne wala rahmat ka muntazir rehta hai. Tajir rizq ka muntazir rehta hai aur zakheera-andozi karne wala la'nat ka muntazir rehta hai. Noha karne wali aur us ke gird sunne wali auraton par Allah Ta'ala, farishton aur tamam logon ki la'nat hai."
"312","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Azza wa Jalla ki ita'at mein lambi umar guzarna siwae khush-naseebi ke kuch nahin."
"313","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Jarad (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jise Roz-e-Qayamat ne pa liya (yani woh mara nahin), us ki bad-bakhti haqeeqi bad-bakhti hai."
"314","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apne ghar walon aur matahton ko (haram) maal ke sath chhod jae aur khud apne Rabb se gunah liye hue mile, us ke liye halakat par halakat ke siwa kuch nahin."
"315","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mazloom ki dua qabool hoti hai agarche woh gunahgar ho, kyunke us ki gunahgari (us ka wabal) usi par hai."
"316","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Teen (afrad) ki duayen (yaqeenan) qabool hoti hain, un ki qabooliyat mein koi shak nahin: Mazloom ki dua, musafir ki dua, aur walid ki apni aulad ke khilaf dua."
"317","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qaziyon ki teen qismein hain: Do Jahannam mein aur ek Jannat mein. Jo qazi Allah ke nazil-kardah ke khilaf faisla de woh Jahannam mein hai, aur jo qazi apni khwahishat ke mutabiq faisla de woh bhi Jahannam mein hai, aur jo qazi Allah ke nazil-kardah ke mutabiq faisla de woh Jannat mein hai."
"318","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Salam (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Do achchi khaslatein munafiq mein nahin payi jatin: Husn-e-khuluq aur deen mein samajh."
"319","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Do buri khaslatein momin mein jama nahin hotin: Bukhl aur bad-khuluqi."
"320","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) apne walid, Hazrat Abbas bin Abdul Muttalib (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat karte hain, jinhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Do qism ki aankhein hain jinhen (Jahannam ki) aag nahin chhuyegi: Ek aankh jo aadhi raat mein Allah ke khauf se royi, aur doosri aankh jo raat mein Allah ki rah mein pehra deti rahi."
"321","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Do qism ki aankhein hain jinhen aag nahin chhuyegi: Ek aankh jo Allah ke khauf se royi, aur doosri aankh jo Allah ki rah mein pehra deti rahi."
"322","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Do qism ke bhooke, lalchi log kabhi sair nahin hote: Ek ilm talash karne wala aur doosra duniya talash karne wala."
"323","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Budha aadmi do cheezon mein jawan rehta hai: Lambi umar ki mohabbat mein aur kasrat-e-maal ki mohabbat mein."
"324","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Chaar qism ke log hain jinhen Allah napasand farmata hai: Qasmein kha kar maal bechne wala, mutakabbir faqeer, budha zaniya, aur zalim hukmaran."
"325","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Teen cheezein halak karne wali hain aur teen cheezein nijat dene wali hain. Teen halak karne wali cheezein hain: Bukhl jis ki ita'at ki jae, nafs ki khwahishat jin ki pairwi ki jae, aur aadmi ka apni ta'reef se khush hona. Aur teen nijat dene wali cheezein hain: Chhup kar aur khul kar Allah se darna, maal-dari aur faqr mein miyana-rawi, aur khushi aur ghusse ki halat mein adl karna."
"326","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Teen cheezein halak karne wali hain aur teen cheezein nijat dene wali hain. Pas teen halak karne wali cheezein hain: Bukhl jis ki ita'at ki jae, nafs ki khwahishat jin ki pairwi ki jae, aur aadmi ka apni ta'reef se khush hona. Aur teen nijat dene wali cheezein hain: Har halat mein chhup kar aur khul kar Allah se darna, maal-dari aur faqr (donon halaton) mein miyana-rawi ikhtiyar karna, aur khushi aur ghusse mein adl o insaf se kaam lena."
"327","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Teen cheezein halak karne wali hain aur teen cheezein nijat dene wali hain. Teen halak karne wali cheezein hain: Bukhl jis ki ita'at ki jae, nafs ki khwahishat jin ki pairwi ki jae, aur aadmi ka apni ta'reef se khush hona. Aur teen nijat dene wali cheezein hain: Chhup kar aur khul kar Allah se darna, maal-dari aur faqr mein miyana-rawi, aur khushi aur ghusse mein adl karna."
"328","[AI-translation] Hasan al-Basri (Rahimahullah) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aapas mein gali-galoch karne wale jo bhi kahen to (us ka wabal) pehal karne wale par hoga jab tak ke mazloom hadd se tajawuz na kare."
"329","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke beshak Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aapas mein gali-galoch karne wale jo bhi kahen to (us ka wabal) pehal karne wale par hoga jab tak ke mazloom hadd se tajawuz na kare. Aur use Muslim bin Hajjaj ne bhi apni sanad ke sath Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat kiya hai woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aapas mein gali-galoch karne wale jo bhi kahen to (us ka wabal) pehal karne wale par hoga jab tak ke mazloom hadd se tajawuz na kare."
"330","[AI-translation] Ubaid bin Umair (Rahimahullah) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main Roz-e-Qayamat Hauz (Hauz-e-Kausar) par tum se aage hunga."
"331","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jundub bin Sufyan Bajali (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Main Roz-e-Qayamat Hauz (Hauz-e-Kausar) par tum se aage hunga."
"332","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Sa'd (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main aur yateem ki kafalat karne wala Jannat mein is tarah (ek doosre ke qareeb) honge."
"333","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Ae Banu Hashim! Ae Banu Qusayy! Main khabardar karne wala hun, maut halak karne wali hai, aur Roz-e-Qayamat muqarrar waqt hai."
"334","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo khamosh raha us ne nijat payi."
"335","[AI-translation] Abis bin Rabi'ah kehte hain ke Hazrat Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne mimbar par farmaya: Ae logo! Tawazu' ikhtiyar karo, beshak main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko yeh farmate suna hai: Jo shakhs Allah ke liye tawazu' ikhtiyar kare, Allah use rif'at se nawazta hai, phir woh khud ko apni nazron mein chhota samajhta hai jabke logon ki nazron mein woh azeem hota hai. Aur jo shakhs takabbur ikhtiyar kare, Allah Azza wa Jalla use pasti ka shikar kar deta hai phir woh khud ko bada samajhta hai jabke logon ki nazron mein chhota hota hai hatta ke kutte ya khinzeer se bhi haqeer hota hai."
"336","[AI-translation] Hazrat Zaid bin Khalid (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne yeh khutba Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke munh se Tabook mein hasil kiya, pas main ne Aap ko farmate suna ... aur ek taweel khutbe mein unhon ne yeh baat bhi zikr ki ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"337","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna, aur unhon ne is ka zikr ek taweel hadees mein bhi kiya ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"338","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ka hisab sakhti se liya gaya woh azab diya jaega."
"339","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo jungle mein rehne chala gaya sakht-dil ho gaya, jo shikar ke peeche pada ghafil ho gaya, aur jo hukmaranon ke darwazon par gaya fitne mein pad gaya."
"340","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apne maal ki hifazat karte hue qatl kiya gaya woh shaheed hai."
"341","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sa'id bin Zaid (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apne ghar walon ki hifazat karte hue qatl kiya gaya woh shaheed hai."
"342","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sa'id bin Zaid (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apne deen ki hifazat karte hue qatl kiya gaya woh shaheed hai, aur jo apni jaan bachate hue qatl kiya gaya woh bhi shaheed hai."
"343","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sa'id bin Zaid (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apne maal ki hifazat karte hue qatl kiya gaya woh shaheed hai, aur jo apne ghar walon ki hifazat karte hue qatl kiya gaya woh bhi shaheed hai, aur jo apne deen ki hifazat karte hue qatl kiya gaya woh bhi shaheed hai."
"344","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab Allah kisi ke sath bhalayi ka irada farmata hai to use apni taraf se kisi museebat mein mubtala kar deta hai."
"345","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab Allah kisi ke sath bhalayi ka irada farmata hai to use deen ki samajh ata farmata hai."
"346","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Ka'b kehte hain ke Hazrat Muawiyah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke mimbar par farmaya: Allah Ta'ala jis ke sath bhalayi ka irada karta hai use deen ka tafaqquh ata farmata hai. Hazrat Muawiyah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Main ne yeh alfaz Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se sune hain."
"347","[AI-translation] Hazrat Qabeesah bin Zu'aib (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Ta'ala, jab kisi ke sath bhalayi ka irada karta hai, us ka akhlaq achcha kar deta hai."
"348","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Jannat ka mushtaq ho woh nekiyon ki taraf jaldi kare, aur jo Jahannam se dare woh khwahishat se be-raghbat ho jae, aur jo maut ko yaad rakhe woh lazzaton se be-parwah ho jae, aur jo duniya se be-raghbat ho woh museebaton ko aasan samjhe."
"349","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo pardes mein mara woh shaheed ki maut mara."
"350","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo ghulamon par fakhr kare, Allah Ta'ala use ruswa karega."
"351","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae logo! Musalmanon ke darmiyan koi dhoka nahin (hona chahiye) jis shakhs ne hamein dhoka diya woh hum mein se nahin. Aur use Muslim bin Hajjaj ne bhi apni sanad ke sath Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat kiya hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis shakhs ne hum par hathiyar uthaya woh hum mein se nahin aur jis ne hamein dhoka diya woh bhi hum mein se nahin."
"352","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne hamein dhoka diya woh hum mein se nahin, aur jis ne hum par hathiyar uthaya woh bhi hum mein se nahin."
"353","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hamra (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha, Aap ek aadmi ke paas se guzre jis ke paas bartam mein anaaj tha. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us ki taraf dekha aur farmaya: Tu ne dhoka diya. Jis ne hamein dhoka diya woh hum mein se nahin."
"354","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne hamein dhoka diya woh hum mein se nahin, aur jo makkari, fareb aur dhokebazi kare woh aag mein hai."
"355","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne raat mein hum par teer chalaya woh hum mein se nahin."
"356","[AI-translation] Hazrat Zaid bin Arqam (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne apni moonchhen nahin katarin woh hum mein se nahin."
"357","[AI-translation] Mu'tamir kehte hain ke main ne Yusuf bin Suhaib ko Habib bin Yasar se un ki sanad ke sath is jaisi ek hadees bayan karte suna, aur us ke alfaz mein unhon ne kaha: Jis ne apni moonchhen nahin katarin."
"358","[AI-translation] Yeh hadees Hazrat Zaid bin Arqam (Raziyallahu anhu) se ek doosri sanad ke sath bhi marwi hai ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"359","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne hamare mu'amle (deen) mein woh cheez dakhil ki jo us mein se nahin, woh mardood hai."
"360","[AI-translation] Ibrahim bin Sa'd ne apne walid se un ki sanad ke sath is jaisi ek hadees bayan ki ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"361","[AI-translation] Ibrahim bin Sa'd ne apni sanad ke sath is jaisi ek hadees bayan ki ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"362","[AI-translation] Hazrat Uqbah bin Amir (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne ghaur o fikr se kaam liya woh (haq ko) pa leta hai ya us ke qareeb aajata hai, aur jis ne jaldi se kaam liya woh ghalti karta hai ya ghalti ke qareeb aajata hai."
"363","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Jis ne ghaur o fikr se kaam liya woh (haq ko) pa leta hai, ya (haq ke) qareeb aajata hai, aur jis ne jaldi se kaam liya woh ghalti karta hai, ya (ghalti ke) qareeb aajata hai."
"364","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne bhalayi boyee woh khwahish ki fasal katega, aur jis ne burayi boyee woh nadamat ki fasal katega."
"365","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne bhalayi boyee woh khwahish ki fasal katega, aur jis ne burayi boyee woh nadamat ki fasal katega."
"366","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna ... aur ek taweel hadees mein unhon ne yeh baat bhi zikr ki ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"367","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Ka'b se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Umar bin Abdul Aziz se kaha ke hamein Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne hadees bayan karte hue kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek taweel hadees bayan karte hue farmaya: Aur jise yeh pasand ho ke woh logon mein sab se zyada izzat wala ho to use chahiye ke Allah se dare aur jise yeh pasand ho ke woh logon mein se zyada taqatwar ho to use chahiye ke Allah par bharosa rakhe aur jise yeh pasand ho ke woh logon mein sab se zyada ghani aur maldar ho to use chahiye ke jo kuch Allah ke hath mein hai us par apna e'temad aur yaqeen us se zyada kare jo us ke apne hath mein hai."
"368","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo chahe ke woh logon mein sab se zyada izzat wala ho use chahiye ke Allah se dare, aur jo chahe ke woh logon mein sab se zyada ghani ho use chahiye ke jo kuch Allah ke paas hai us par us se zyada e'temad aur yaqeen rakhe jo us ke apne hath mein hai."
"369","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo gunah ka irada kare phir use chhod de, us ke liye ek neki hai. Aur jo gunah ka irada kare phir us par amal kare, phir Allah se bakhshish mange, use bakhsh diya jaega."
"370","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jise Allah maal ata farmaye, woh us par zaroor zahir hona chahiye, aur us par wajib hai ke apne matahton se aaghaz kare, aur jo bache use (doosre) zaroorat-mand logon ki taraf lautade. Qana'at karne wale ko malamat na karo, aur khud ko aajiz na samjho."
"371","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo mehfooz rehna pasand kare use chahiye ke khamoshi ko lazim pakde."
"372","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ki guftagu zyada hogi us ki ghaltiyan bhi zyada hongi, aur jis ki ghaltiyan zyada hongi us ke gunah bhi zyada honge, aur jis ke gunah zyada honge woh Jahannam ka zyada mustahiq hai. Suno! Jo Allah aur Roz-e-Aakhirat par iman rakhta hai use chahiye ke achchi baat kahe ya khamosh rahe."
"373","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Jis ki guftagu zyada hogi us ki ghaltiyan bhi zyada hongi, aur jis ki ghaltiyan zyada hongi us ke gunah bhi zyada honge, aur jis ke gunah zyada honge woh Jahannam ka zyada mustahiq hai. Aur jo Allah aur Roz-e-Aakhirat par iman rakhta hai use chahiye ke achchi baat kahe ya khamosh rahe."
"374","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ki guftagu zyada hogi us ki ghaltiyan bhi zyada hongi, aur jis ki guftagu zyada hogi us ka jhoot bhi zyada hoga aur jis ka jhoot zyada hoga us ke gunah bhi zyada honge aur jis ke gunah zyada honge woh dozakh ka zyada mustahiq hai. Abu Ahmad ne kaha: Main is hadees ko wahm samajhta hun, kyunke yeh baat sirf Hazrat Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) hi se marwi hai. Main ne use Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se sirf isi sanad ke sath hifz kiya hai. Baqi rahi hadees-e-Umar, to hamein woh Ibn Duraid ne apni sanad ke sath Ahnaf bin Qais se bayan ki, unhon ne kaha ke mujhe Umar ne kaha: Ae Ahnaf! Jis ka hansna zyada ho jae us ki haibat kam ho jati hai, aur jo zyada mazaq kare use haqeer samjha jata hai, aur jo kisi cheez mein zyada ho woh usi se pehchana jata hai."
"375","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jise kisi zariye se rizq mile use chahiye ke use lazim pakde."
"376","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Jise koi nemat ata ki jae, use chahiye ke us par shukr ada kare."
"377","[AI-translation] Hazrat Nu'man bin Bashir (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mimbar par chadhe aur farmaya: Jo thode par shukr ada nahin karta, woh zyada par shukr ada nahin karega, aur jo logon ka shukr ada nahin karta, woh Allah ka shukr ada nahin karta."
"378","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo museebat-zada se taziyat kare us ke liye museebat-zada ke barabar ajar hoga."
"379","[AI-translation] Yeh hadees Hazrat Abdullah bin Masud (Raziyallahu anhu) se ek doosri sanad ke sath isi tarah marwi hai ... aur hadees isi tarah riwayat ki gayi."
"380","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo museebat-zada se taziyat kare, us ke liye us (museebat-zada) shakhs ke barabar ajar hai."
"381","[AI-translation] Yeh hadees Muhammad bin Sauqah se ek doosri sanad ke sath isi tarah marwi hai ... aur hadees isi tarah riwayat ki gayi."
"382","[AI-translation] Hazrat Zaid bin Khalid (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo roza-dar ko iftar karae, us ke liye us (roza-dar) shakhs ke barabar ajar hoga."
"383","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo meri ummat se narmi kare Allah Ta'ala us se narmi farmayega, aur jo meri ummat se sakhti kare Allah Ta'ala us se sakhti farmayega."
"384","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sauban (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo beemar ki iyadat kare woh hamesha Jannat ke khurfa mein rahega. Poocha gaya: Allah ke Rasul! Jannat ka khurfa kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Us ke phal."
"385","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sauban (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo beemar ki iyadat kare woh wapas lautne tak Jannat ki fasal mein rehta hai."
"386","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne apne zalim ke khilaf (bad-)dua ki to beshak us ne apne zulm ka badla le liya."
"387","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne apne zalim ke khilaf (bad-)dua ki to beshak us ne us par kiye gae zulm ka badla le liya."
"388","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne apne zalim ke khilaf (bad-)dua ki to beshak us ne (zulm ka) badla le liya."
"389","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mu'az bin Jabal (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs kisi zalim ke sath chala to beshak us ne bhi jurm kiya. Allah Ta'ala farmata hai: Beshak hum mujrimon se inteqam lene wale hain."
"390","[AI-translation] Tawoos kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne kisi qaum se mushabehat ikhtiyar ki woh unhi mein se hai."
"391","[AI-translation] Hazrat Zaid bin Harisah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jis ne ilm hasil kiya, Allah us ke rizq ka zimmedar hota hai."
"392","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ka ilm use nafa na de, us ki jahalat use nuqsan degi. Quran padho; woh tumhen rokega. Agar woh tumhen na roke, to (goya) tum ne use padha hi nahin."
"393","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jise us ke amal ne peeche kar diya use us ka nasab aage nahin kar sakta. Aur Ibn Jami' ki hadees mein lam yusri' ke bajae la yusri' ke alfaz hain."
"394","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Ja'far, apni sanad ke sath riwayat karte hue, kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo ilm ki talash mein kisi raste par chala, Allah use Jannat ke raste par le jaega. Aur jo apne ilm se peeche reh gaya, us ka nasab use aage nahin badhayega."
"395","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Jise qazi banaya gaya haqeeqatan use chhuri ke baghair zibah kiya gaya. Yeh hadees Fawa'id Ibnul A'rabi mein bhi hai aur is mein hai: Pas haqeeqatan use chhuri ke baghair zibah kiya gaya. Aur Za'farani ki hadees mein yeh lafz faqad (haqeeqatan) ke baghair hai. Aur main ne use Sufyan Sauri ke shuyookh ki Mu'jam mein Ammarah bin Ghaziyyah an Sa'id al-Maqburi an Abi Hurairah ki sanad se dekha hai, unhon ne use marfoo' bayan kiya hai aur is mein faqad (haqeeqatan) ka lafz maujood hai."
"396","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo mansab-e-qaza par muqarrar kiya gaya haqeeqatan use chhuri ke baghair zibah kiya gaya."
"397","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne apna bojh khud uthaya beshak us ne khud ko takabbur se aazad kar liya."
"398","[AI-translation] Hazrat Buraidah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne is deen mein sakht rawi ikhtiyar ki, to yeh (deen) us par ghalib aajayega."
"399","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne shafa'at ka inkar kiya woh Roz-e-Qayamat use nahin paega."
"400","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apni neki se khush ho aur apni burayi se ghamgeen ho, to woh momin hai."
